			"notes": "# BleachHack 1.21.11 — First Port\n\nFirst public build of the **BleachHack** port to **Minecraft 1.21.11**.\n\n> ⚠️ **Vibe code:** this port was made with heavy AI assistance. It works, but expect rough edges and the occasional bug. Back up your world/configs before using.\n\n## 📦 What's included\n\n- `BleachHack-1.21.11.jar` — the mod itself\n- Ported to Minecraft **1.21.11**\n- Fabric Loader + Fabric API required\n\n## 🔧 Requirements\n\n- **Minecraft:** 1.21.11\n- **Java:** 21+\n- **Fabric Loader** for 1.21.11\n- **Fabric API** for 1.21.11\n\n## 🚀 Installation\n\n1. Install [Fabric Loader](https://fabricmc.net/use/) for **1.21.11**.\n2. Drop [Fabric API](https://modrinth.com/mod/fabric-api) into `.minecraft/mods/`.\n3. Download `bleachhack-1.2.6.jar` from the assets below.\n4. Put it into `.minecraft/mods/`.\n5. Launch the game with the Fabric profile.\n\n## ✅ What works\n\n- Core modules ported to 1.21.11\n- In-game GUI and config system\n- Basic utility modules (see in-game list)\n\n## ⚠️ Known issues\n\n- Some modules may behave differently than upstream\n- Not every upstream feature is ported yet\n- Possible crashes on specific module combinations — report them in [Issues](../../issues)\n\n## 🐛 Reporting bugs\n\nPlease include:\n- Minecraft version (should be 1.21.11)\n- Fabric Loader version\n- Fabric API version\n- Full crash log / `latest.log`\n- Steps to reproduce\n\n## 🔗 Links\n\n- **Original project:** [BleachDev/BleachHack](https://github.com/BleachDev/BleachHack)\n- **This fork:** [Legonin-dev/BleachHack-1.21.11](https://github.com/Legonin-dev/BleachHack-1.21.11)\n- **Build from source:** see [README](../..#build-from-source)\n\n## 📜 Credits & License\n\nAll credit for the original code goes to the [BleachHack](https://github.com/BleachDev/BleachHack) authors.\nThis fork only provides the 1.21.11 port. License inherits from upstream.\n\n## ⚠️ Disclaimer\n\nUnofficial fork, not affiliated with the original authors. Use at your own risk. Follow server rules — using utility mods on public servers may result in a ban."
